Revision history for ASPEER-MakeMaker-Markdown-Publish

1.003  2026-09-26

    - Publish public repository metadata through the GitHub mirror.
    - Add contributor and security policies, dependency auditing and
      artifact-attestation verification guidance.
    - Declare the CPAN authority in distribution metadata.

1.002  2026-09-26

    - Initial release.
    - Add MakeMaker targets for each supported publishing backend.
    - Pass x_documentation publishing configuration to the reusable engine.
    - Load ASPEER::MakeMaker::Markdown::Pod so publication-enabled
      Makefile.PL files also receive the local documentation targets.
    - Derive the default site title from WriteMakefile metadata.
    - Add local GitHub Pages branch preparation and explicit push targets.
    - Install pandoc in GitHub Actions for documentation integration tests.
